   "label": "",
   "description": "",
   "required": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "css": "right_html",
   "html": "<div class=\"right_col\"> <h3>How <span>to test?</span></h3> <p>Lie on your back on a flat surface and tuck your chin in. Lift your head 2 cm off the surface and time how long you can hold it until your chin thrusts forward. </p> <img src=\"https://betterhood.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Neck-Flexor-Muscle-Endurance-Test.webp\"> </div>"
  },
  {
   "id": 124,
   "type": "html",
   "page": 2,
   "label": "",
   "description": "",
   "required": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "css": "dyk_html",
   "html": "<div class=\"dyk_wrapper\"> <div class=\"heading\"> <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/did_you_know_light_icon.svg\"> <h3>Did <span>You Know?</span></h3> </div> <p>In today's tech-driven world, weak neck flexor muscles are a major factor in \"tech neck,\" a condition resulting from poor posture during device use that can lead to significant neck strain and discomfort. </p> </div>"
  },
