   "html": "<div class=\"right_col\"> <h3>How <span>to test?</span></h3> <p>Stand on one leg with your knee slightly bent and arms crossed over your chest. Hold the position as long as possible without losing balance, then switch legs. </p> <img src=\"https://betterhood.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Single-leg-balance.webp\"> </div>"
  },
